## Hot Key detection
Hot key skew occurs when one key has a disproportionately large amount of data, causing a single worker to become a bottleneck and slowing down the pipeline.

Combiner → reduces data before shuffle to improve performance
# fanour distributes hot keys to avoid worker bottlenecks

## Fanout ::- distributes hot keys to avoid worker bottlenecks
